2. EXPECTED USER POPULATION

A.R.G.U.S. should initially support approximately 12 authorized users.

Expected maximum:

- 2 instructors
- 4 Supply Officers
- up to 6 Supply Assistants

The architecture should not artificially limit the application to exactly 12 identities, but it should be optimized around a small trusted unit rather than internet-scale public registration.

There is no public account-registration system.

Accounts/identities must be authorized by A.R.G.U.S. authority credentials.

