27. LOCAL STORAGE

The existing localStorage prototype is temporary.

Production/offline architecture should use a durable browser database such as IndexedDB or another appropriately supported client-side storage technology.

The storage layer should be abstracted.

Potential interfaces:

LocalRepository
EventStore
Outbox
ProjectionStore
IdentityStore

Private signing keys must not simply be stored as ordinary application records.

