32. REAL-TIME SYNCHRONIZATION TARGET

Connected clients should ideally synchronize within seconds.

Architecture should include:

- peer/event discovery
- event validation
- duplicate prevention
- ordering
- replay protection
- state versioning
- retry/backoff
- reconnect
- event acknowledgements where appropriate
- corruption recovery
- conflict detection

