35. READINESS ENGINE

A.R.G.U.S. should eventually calculate readiness dynamically.

Examples:

Cadet Readiness:
percentage of cadets completely issued

Inventory Readiness:
percentage of required inventory sufficiently stocked/reconciled

Event Readiness:
percentage of event preparation tasks complete

Audit Readiness:
percentage of important events synchronized/verified

Overall Supply Readiness:
weighted result across appropriate categories

Weights should eventually be configurable.

